Phase 4 – Project Planning
1. Project Title
FitBuddy – AI Fitness Plan Generator using Gemini Models
2. Project Objective
The objective of FitBuddy is to develop an AI-powered fitness assistant that generates personalized fitness plans based on the user's fitness information and goals using Google Gemini models.
3. Project Scope
FitBuddy will allow users to:
Enter their basic fitness information.
Select their fitness goal.
Generate a personalized fitness plan using Gemini AI.
View workout recommendations and weekly schedules.
Receive general nutrition suggestions.
Regenerate the plan when required.
