5. Development Plan
Stage 1 – Interface Development
Create the user interface and fitness information form.
Stage 2 – Gemini Integration
Connect the application with the Google Gemini model.
Stage 3 – Prompt Development
Create prompts that send the user's fitness information to Gemini.
Stage 4 – Output Display
Display the generated fitness plan in an easy-to-read format.
Stage 5 – Testing
Test different user inputs and verify the generated results.
Stage 6 – Finalization
Fix errors, improve the interface, and prepare the project for demonstration.
6. Team Responsibilities
Team Member 1: Frontend development
Team Member 2: Gemini AI integration
Team Member 3: Testing and debugging
Team Member 4: Documentation and presentation
If your team has fewer members, you can combine the responsibilities.
